{"version":1,"content":"<p>人工智能在數學領域能力的快速提升，正在對高校教學方式產生深遠影響。近日，美國加州理工學院的一門數學課程引發關注，任教17年的數學教授倪毅（Yi Ni）表示，由於學生可以輕鬆利用人工智能完成作業，他已經不再按照答案是否正確來評分，而只根據學生是否提交作業給予成績。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586790.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:13:42.562574+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T12:04:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:06:55.348594+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:06:55.348594+00:00","content_hash":"759c640d1e62b44405df8805b03dc245d93ad0c77fd34258f5a9166202702c1e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}